112
00:30:12,660 --> 00:30:34,660
Personal development is a post-sures, is an often used but rarely explained term. It is about investing in yourself so that you can manage yourself effectively regardless of what life might bring your way. Personal development allows you to be proactive. Rather than wait for good things to happen, you get out there and make them happen.

113
00:30:35,220 --> 00:30:43,220
You may not always achieve your objective, but you will experience a richer and more rewarding life when you commit to pursuing your own objectives.

114
00:30:43,220 --> 00:30:49,220
The following are six of the most important benefits of a personal development mindset.

115
00:30:49,220 --> 00:30:54,220
One self-awareness personal development begins with self-awareness.

116
00:30:54,220 --> 00:30:58,956
You get to know who you really are, your beliefs and the purpose you wish to pursue.

117
00:30:59,251 --> 00:31:04,251
If you want to achieve lasting happiness, you need to design your life based on who you are.

118
00:31:04,251 --> 00:31:08,251
Then you can chase your own goals and objectives.

119
00:31:08,251 --> 00:31:16,251
When you are chasing your own goals, there is as much pleasure derived from the journey as there is to be derived from reaching your destination.

120
00:31:16,251 --> 00:31:20,875
Self-awareness is the first fundamental step in the personal development process.

121
00:31:21,299 --> 00:31:36,680
Each day you receive information about what you want from life, but if you are not aware, these messages slip by without you even noticing them. Each day you encounter things that you feel bad about.

122
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,680
Sorry.

123
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:49,291
Process. Each day you receive information about what you want from life, but if you are not aware, these messages slip by without you even noticing them.

124
00:31:49,652 --> 00:32:14,052
Each day you encounter things that you feel bad about. You don't like something or you don't like a situation the way it currently is. Imagine if you took the opportunity to ask yourself questions such as, as this is not what I want, what do I want? How would I behave if I did have this skill slash trait? E.g. confidence.

125
00:32:14,963 --> 00:32:20,963
By asking these questions and others like them, you get clearer about what you really want from life.

126
00:32:20,963 --> 00:32:27,963
To a sense of direction once you have raised your self-awareness, you are clearer on the things you wish to achieve in life.

127
00:32:27,963 --> 00:32:36,963
Decision making becomes a lot easier. Tasks that used to take a great deal of your time no longer make it onto your to-do list.

128
00:32:36,963 --> 00:32:38,796
List

129
00:32:39,316 --> 00:32:45,316
You now realize that they do not move you towards your objectives and therefore are not worthy of your time.

130
00:32:45,316 --> 00:32:49,316
This is where many people make a major mistake with goals.

131
00:32:49,316 --> 00:32:53,316
They see goals as something extra that you add to your life.

132
00:32:53,316 --> 00:32:57,316
You find time to work on your goals when you have everything else done.

133
00:32:57,316 --> 00:33:03,316
When you set goals this way, you think you are going to make your life bigger and better by adding more to it.

134
00:33:04,084 --> 00:33:19,284
The biggest mistake in personal development is trying to do more. If you want to improve, the real key to success is to do less and do it better. When you have a clear sense of direction, you can eliminate anything which does not take you in that direction.

135
00:33:20,584 --> 00:33:28,584
3. Improved focus and effectiveness. Even with an improved sense of direction, there will always be multiple tasks looking for your attention.

136
00:33:29,044 --> 00:33:34,044
As your personal development improves, prioritization becomes much easier.

137
00:33:34,044 --> 00:33:43,044
You are clearer on your objectives and you can quickly identify which task will give you the best results of the resources available to you at that moment.

138
00:33:43,044 --> 00:33:48,044
Improved focus and effectiveness comes with knowing and playing to your strengths.

139
00:33:48,044 --> 00:33:51,403
One of the biggest obstacles to focus is distraction.

140
00:33:51,731 --> 00:34:01,731
Distraction mostly happens because you don't see the great difference between the benefit you will derive from the activity you should be doing and the one you are distracting yourself with.

141
00:34:01,731 --> 00:34:12,731
Therefore, you work better when there is a deadline ahead i.e. the benefit of meeting the deadline becomes much clearer and the problems caused by the distractions become just as apparent.

142
00:34:12,731 --> 00:34:19,403
For more motivation when you know what you want to achieve, it is easier for you to see the benefits of taking action.

143
00:34:19,699 --> 00:34:26,800
Even when the task ahead is not enjoyable, if you can see a clear benefit, you are more motivated to take the necessary actions.

144
00:34:26,800 --> 00:34:31,199
There is truth in the old saying where there is a will, there is a way.

145
00:34:31,199 --> 00:34:35,699
With strong personal development, you develop the necessary will.

146
00:34:35,699 --> 00:34:45,699
Once you accept that personal development is a continuous journey and you commit to that journey, you realize that each day you will become a little clearer about what you want.

147
00:34:46,260 --> 00:34:55,260
As you become clearer about your desires, you start to see how achieving your goal will improve your life. You can visualize the benefits you will.

